sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as "Manager/HR"
    participant View as "Web View (approvals.business-trips.index)"
    participant Controller as "BusinessTripApprovalController"
    participant Model as "BusinessTrip Model"
    participant DB as "Database"

    Admin->>View: Klik Export (PDF/Excel/CSV)
    View->>Controller: GET /approvals/business-trips/export?filter&format
    Controller->>Model: Build query export sesuai filter
    Model->>DB: SELECT business_trips + relasi worker/approvedBy
    DB-->>Model: Dataset ekspor
    Model-->>Controller: Data siap diekspor

    alt Data valid (format valid & query berhasil)
        Controller->>View: Return file pdf/xlsx/csv
        View-->>Admin: File unduhan berhasil
    else Data tidak valid (query gagal/format bermasalah)
        Controller->>View: Back + error
        View-->>Admin: Notifikasi gagal ekspor pengajuan
    end
